**PHI Patterns Detected:**
- Member ID: `\b(MEMBER|MEMB|ID)[-_]?\d{6,}\b`
- SSN: `\b\d{3}-\d{2}-\d{4}\b`
- Claim ID: `\b(CLAIM|CLM)[-_]?\d{8,}\b`
- MRN: `\b(MRN|MR)[-_]?\d{6,}\b`
- Patient Name: `(Mr|Mrs|Ms|Dr)\.?\s+[A-Z][a-z]+\s+[A-Z][a-z]+`
- Phone: `\b\d{3}-\d{3}-\d{4}\b`
- Email: `\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Z|a-z]{2,}\b`
- Medical Record: `\b(MEDICAL|RECORD|MR)[-_]?\d{6,}\b`
- Patient ID: `\b(PATIENT|PT)[-_]?\d{6,}\b`
- Health Plan ID: `\b(HP|HEALTH|PLAN)[-_]?\d{6,}\b`

**NLP Entities Detected:**
- PERSON names
- ORGANizations (healthcare providers)
- DATEs (birth dates, admission dates)
- GPE (geopolitical entities)
- LOC (locations)

**Stripping Fields:**
