## Technical Architecture

### Data Flow

```
[Connectors] → [Kafka: raw-security-events] → [Normalization Engine]
                                                         │
                                                         ├─→ [1. Business Process Mapping]
                                                         │      (asset → process)
                                                         │
                                                         ├─→ [2. PHI Stripping]
                                                         │      (regex + NLP)
                                                         │
                                                         ├─→ [3. Blast Radius]
                                                         │      (BFS traversal)
                                                         │
                                                         ├─→ [4. Regulatory Mapping]
                                                         │      (HIPAA, CMS)
                                                         │
                                                         ├─→ [5. Validation]
                                                         │      (schema check)
                                                         │
                                                         └─→ [6. Methodology Trail Update]
                                                                (audit trail)
                                                                     │
                                                                     ▼
                                                        [Kafka: enriched-risk-objects]
```

